# Grafdigger's Cage: "Creature cards in ... libraries can't enter the battlefield" (CR 101.2, 101.3). On turn 1 Bot1
# casts the Cage, then Collected Company, choosing Llanowar Elves from the top six: it can't be put onto the battlefield,
# so it stays in the library and goes to the bottom with the rest (the "rest" are the cards not put onto the battlefield).
# On turn 3 Fabled Passage finds a Forest, a noncreature card in the library, which enters tapped: the control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Grafdigger's Cage
Collected Company
Fabled Passage
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Plains
Forest
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

