Bot1.Hand.Grafdigger's Cage.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Collected Company.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Arrange(Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Grafdigger's Cage; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Fabled Passage.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Fabled Passage.Activate
Bot1.Search(Forest)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

